zker-administration-awards-3-5-million-in-restore-reinvest-and-renew-program-grants-in-response-to-summer-violence","summary":"\nCHICAGO— Using revenue generated from adult-use cannabis sales, the Illinois\nCriminal Justice Information Authority (ICJIA) today announced 21 grants totaling $3.5\nmillion to organizations offering young people and emerging adults (ages 10 to 25) prosocial activities that may reduce violence and victimization or provide increased street\nintervention this summer. Grant awards will support three months of programming, from\nJuly 1 to September 30.","category":"pressRelease","searchMeta":"R3 r3 restore reinvest renew ","published_at":"2021-07-29T12:47:05.620Z","dateOverride":"2021-07-16","tags":["R3","Cannabis","Press Release"],"splash":{"name":"r3.jpg","caption":"","alternativeText":"","url":"/uploads/r3_a7cad5e152.jpg","formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_r3.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_r3_a7cad5e152","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":245,"height":138,"size":7.2,"path":null,"url":"/uploads/thumbnail_r3_a7cad5e152.jpg"},"small":{"name":"small_r3.jpg","hash":"small_r3_a7cad5e152","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":282,"size":19.27,"path":null,"url":"/uploads/small_r3_a7cad5e152.jpg"}}},"altTitle":"pritzker administration awards $3.5 million in restore, reinvest, and renew program grants in response to summer violence","fullPath":"/news/pritzker-administration-awards-3-5-million-in-restore-reinvest-and-renew-program-grants-in-response-to-summer-violence","imagePath":"https://agency.icjia-api.cloud/uploads/r3_a7cad5e152.jpg","displayCategory":"pressRelease","contentType":"news","publicationDate":"2021-07-16","tagsAlt":[{"title":"R3","slug":"r3"},{"title":"Cannabis","slug":"cannabis"},{"title":"Press Release","slug":"press-release"}]},{"id":"16","title":"Webinar: The Pandemic's Impact on Illinois Criminal Justice and Victim Services","created_at":"2021-08-02T21:46:09.463Z","updated_at":"2021-08-02T22:20:25.964Z","slug